 "subs": [
  {
   "a": 0.25,
   "b": 2.493,
   "zh": "这是 Anthropic 官方放出的一段对谈",
   "kind": "nar"
  },
  {
   "a": 2.543,
   "b": 5.195,
   "zh": "主角是 Claude Code 团队的三位工程师",
   "kind": "nar"
  },
  {
   "a": 5.395,
   "b": 7.204,
   "zh": "负责提问的是 Thariq",
   "kind": "nar"
  },
  {
   "a": 7.404,
   "b": 9.467,
   "zh": "另外两位是 Sid 和 Robert",
   "kind": "nar"
  },
  {
   "a": 9.517,
   "b": 11.337,
   "zh": "Robert 正在做 Claude Tag",
   "kind": "nar"
  },
  {
   "a": 11.737,
   "b": 13.014,
   "zh": "做 Claude Code 的人",
   "kind": "nar"
  },
  {
   "a": 13.064,
   "b": 14.629,
   "zh": "自己怎么用 Claude Code？",
   "kind": "nar"
  },
  {
   "a": 14.679,
   "b": 15.639,
   "zh": "答案先放在前面",
   "kind": "nar"
  },
  {
   "a": 15.689,
   "b": 17.946,
   "zh": "他们已经不给它下指令了，只给目标",
   "kind": "nar"
  },
  {
   "a": 18.296,
   "b": 19.611,
   "zh": "这句话站得住吗？",
   "kind": "nar"
  },
  {
   "a": 19.661,
   "b": 21.317,
   "zh": "站得住，但有一个前提",
   "kind": "nar"
  },
  {
   "a": 21.367,
   "b": 23.363,
   "zh": "模型得先好到，让人敢放手",
   "kind": "nar"
  },
  {
   "a": 23.713,
   "b": 24.324,
   "zh": "分三步看",
   "kind": "nar"
  },
  {
   "a": 24.374,
   "b": 27.13,
   "zh": "第一，人怎么从盯过程，变成只给目标",
   "kind": "nar"
  },
  {
   "a": 27.18,
   "b": 30.267,
   "zh": "第二，做出来的功能，为什么要随时准备删",
   "kind": "nar"
  },
  {
   "a": 30.317,
   "b": 31.918,
   "zh": "第三，人最后还剩什么",
   "kind": "nar"
  },
  {
   "a": 32.368,
   "b": 32.859,
   "zh": "第一步",
   "kind": "nar"
  },
  {
   "a": 32.909,
   "b": 34.409,
   "zh": "Sid 七八成的工作",
   "kind": "nar"
  },
  {
   "a": 34.459,
   "b": 37.436,
   "zh": "都在 Slack 里的 Claude Tag 上完成",
   "kind": "nar"
  },
  {
   "a": 38.636,
   "b": 40.636,
   "zh": "以前在意每一次工具调用、",
   "en": "caring about each individual tool call",
   "kind": "clip"
  },
  {
   "a": 40.636,
   "b": 43.136,
   "zh": "模型做的每一个决定；",
   "en": "and each individual decision that the model makes",
   "kind": "clip"
  },
  {
   "a": 43.136,
   "b": 48.436,
   "zh": "现在退远一步：我有一个目标，我想把它达成。",
   "en": "to just zoomed out view of like, I have a goal and I'd like to achieve this goal.",
   "kind": "clip"
  },
  {
   "a": 49.136,
   "b": 52.736,
   "zh": "然后把这个目标交给模型，让它替你完成。",
   "en": "And you just kind of give that goal to the model to achieve for you.",
   "kind": "clip"
  },
  {
   "a": 53.036,
   "b": 54.434,
   "zh": "这一步只要记住一句",
   "kind": "nar"
  },
  {
   "a": 54.484,
   "b": 56.847,
   "zh": "交给它一个目标，步骤让它自己排",
   "kind": "nar"
  },
  {
   "a": 57.397,
   "b": 59.612,
   "zh": "第二步，功能为什么要随时准备删",
   "kind": "nar"
  },
  {
   "a": 59.912,
   "b": 63.912,
   "zh": "给它五件事，做完三件就放弃了。",
   "en": "You'd give it like five things to do and it would do three things and just give up.",
   "kind": "clip"
  },
  {
   "a": 64.512,
   "b": 67.912,
   "zh": "我们就想：要不给它一张待办清单？效果很好。",
   "en": "So we were like, oh, maybe you give it a to-do list and it'll do really well.",
   "kind": "clip"
  },
  {
   "a": 67.912,
   "b": 72.112,
   "zh": "可一年后，它就消失了，待办清单已经用不上了。",
   "en": "But a year from then, it's disappeared. You don't really need the to-do list anymore.",
   "kind": "clip"
  },
  {
   "a": 72.112,
   "b": 77.212,
   "zh": "你得对自己做的东西毫不留恋，",
   "en": "…you got to be very unattached to the things you're building",
   "kind": "clip"
  },
  {
   "a": 77.212,
   "b": 80.012,
   "zh": "因为它们很快就会消失。",
   "en": "because they're going to go away fairly quickly.",
   "kind": "clip"
  },
  {
   "a": 80.262,
   "b": 82.614,
   "zh": "底层模型，每两个月就换一次",
   "kind": "nar"
  },
  {
   "a": 82.664,
   "b": 84.018,
   "zh": "Thariq 的说法是—",
   "kind": "nar"
  },
  {
   "a": 84.068,
   "b": 84.203,
   "zh": "—",
   "kind": "nar"
  },
  {
   "a": 84.503,
   "b": 90.003,
   "zh": "某种程度上，我们就是软件开发未来的「精神时光屋」。",
   "en": "So I think in some ways, we're this hyperbolic time chamber of where software development is going.",
   "kind": "clip"
  },
  {
   "a": 90.303,
   "b": 91.463,
   "zh": "这一步记住一句",
   "kind": "nar"
  },
  {
   "a": 91.513,
   "b": 94.231,
   "zh": "今天救命的功能，明年可能就是包袱",
   "kind": "nar"
  },
  {
   "a": 94.781,
   "b": 96.436,
   "zh": "第三步，人最后还剩什么",
   "kind": "nar"
  },
  {
   "a": 96.486,
   "b": 97.987,
   "zh": "以前审代码是这样的—",
   "kind": "nar"
  },
  {
   "a": 98.037,
   "b": 98.142,
   "zh": "—",
   "kind": "nar"
  },
  {
   "a": 98.442,
   "b": 102.142,
   "zh": "审代码的人会挑出三个小毛病发上去，",
   "en": "and they would pick out three little nitpicks to post.",
   "kind": "clip"
  },
  {
   "a": 102.442,
   "b": 106.142,
   "zh": "其实就是在告诉你：这段代码我看过了。",
   "en": "It was kind of just like, I'm signaling to you that I read this code.",
   "kind": "clip"
  },
  {
   "a": 106.142,
   "b": 111.542,
   "zh": "现在，这些小问题可以交给 Claude 自己找、自己改。",
   "en": "Now, you can have Claude figure out those little things and address them autonomously.",
   "kind": "clip"
  },
  {
   "a": 111.942,
   "b": 114.842,
   "zh": "这已经不是人审代码的重点了。",
   "en": "That's not really the important part of human code review anymore.",
   "kind": "clip"
  },
  {
   "a": 115.092,
   "b": 117.308,
   "zh": "现在，人只盯 Claude 没想明白的",
   "kind": "nar"
  },
  {
   "a": 117.358,
   "b": 119.171,
   "zh": "接口怎么设计，边界划在哪",
   "kind": "nar"
  },
  {
   "a": 119.221,
   "b": 120.443,
   "zh": "在 Claude Tag 里",
   "kind": "nar"
  },
  {
   "a": 120.493,
   "b": 121.84,
   "zh": "连它每一步在想什么",
   "kind": "nar"
  },
  {
   "a": 121.89,
   "b": 122.616,
   "zh": "都看不到了",
   "kind": "nar"
  },
  {
   "a": 122.966,
   "b": 126.266,
   "zh": "这层抽象，一开始有点吓人。",
   "en": "And that abstraction was like a little scary to get through at first.",
   "kind": "clip"
  },
  {
   "a": 126.366,
   "b": 129.466,
   "zh": "我看不到 Claude 当下在想的每一件事。",
   "en": "I can't see everything that Claude is thinking as it's thinking it.",
   "kind": "clip"
  },
  {
   "a": 129.466,
   "b": 133.266,
   "zh": "就像被逼着放手，让它自己发挥。",
   "en": "And like being forced even to let Claude cook.",
   "kind": "clip"
  },
  {
   "a": 133.666,
   "b": 134.93,
   "zh": "回到开头那个判断",
   "kind": "nar"
  },
  {
   "a": 134.98,
   "b": 137.721,
   "zh": "站得住，因为模型已经好到让人敢放手",
   "kind": "nar"
  },
  {
   "a": 137.771,
   "b": 140.84,
   "zh": "模型每两个月换一次，你搭的流程迟早要拆",
   "kind": "nar"
  },
  {
   "a": 140.89,
   "b": 143.467,
   "zh": "能留下来的，只有你给它的那个目标",
   "kind": "nar"
  }
 ],
